# A blacklist, not a whitelist: the build context must contain the whole workspace manifest graph,
# and a `*` + exceptions form silently drops nested directories whose parent was not re-included.
# Only the things that are large, private, or never read by a build are excluded here.

.git
.github
.trellis
.claude
target
**/target
config
node_modules

# Never put local credentials, keys or trust bundles into the daemon context. A deployment that
# needs one mounts it at runtime instead (see deploy/bootstrap.yaml's commented tls section).
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Build output and editor state are noise that invalidates the layer cache for no reason.
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
